00:52:56,950 --> 00:53:07,030
and and curl's prevalence on everything everywhere is partly due to it being massively portable and it is this portable because it is written in C.

557
00:53:07,030 --> 00:53:12,230
So even if we had kept the hyper back end, we would have kept the native one as well.

